# Per-icon overrides. Optional: this file may be empty.
#
#   <Identifier>  <pack|->  [threshold]
#
#   pack       force a pack when several ship the same name. "-" keeps the
#              default order in scripts/icon_index.py.
#   threshold  alpha cut for the 1-bit raster, 1..254, default 96. Lower keeps
#              thin strokes; raise it to thin a glyph that fills in.
#
# Icons themselves are never declared here -- reference Icon::Name in code and
# run scripts/gen_icons.py. Use --search to find a name, --preview to judge a
# threshold before flashing.

# Lucide draws strokes, not fills. At badge size its 2px-on-24 stroke lands
# near one pixel, so these are cut lower to keep the ring and its glyph joined.
CircleCheck14    -   64
CircleX14        -   64
CircleSmall14    -   64
CircleCheck24    -   80

# Radar targets must point along their track, so these carry 24 evenly spaced
# rotations (15 degrees apart), rasterized from the vector at build time. Two
# sizes stand in for the emitter-category scaling the old vector glyph did.
# rot=N stores N evenly spaced headings. The angle that makes frame 0 point
# north comes from the pack's rotation_offset in scripts/icon_index.py, so it
# is set once per pack; add base=D here only for a glyph that disagrees with
# its own pack. The generator measures frame 0 either way and fails the build
# if it is not pointing north.
Plane12          -   80   rot=24
Plane16          -   80   rot=24
